---
import SectionLayout from '../../layouts/SectionLayout.astro';
import Card from '../../components/Card.astro';
import { url } from '../../lib/url';
---

<SectionLayout
	title="About the Chromosomal Instability Network"
	pageTitle="About the Network"
	description="A community of thirty-seven laboratories advancing chromosomal instability research from the bench to the clinic."
>
	<section class="block">
		<h2>What is CIN?</h2>
		<p>
			Chromosomal instability is any process that causes repeated generation of karyotype
			alterations from kilobase scale to whole chromosomes. It is an ongoing
			<strong>rate of change</strong>, not a cell state, which sets it apart from the genome
			complexity and aneuploidy left behind as its scars.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="block">
		<h2>Uniting cell biology, genomics, and the clinic</h2>
		<p>
			CIN drives cancer formation and therapy resistance, but it also offers a chance to transform
			how we treat and prevent cancer. We are uniting cell biology, genomics, and the clinic to
			turn that potential into patient benefit.
		</p>
		<p>[Mission, history, and how the network is organized to come.]</p>
	</section>

	<section class="block split">
		<div>
			<h2>Challenges and a shared roadmap</h2>
			<p>
				The network has identified three major challenges in CIN research and a roadmap for
				addressing them.
			</p>
		</div>
		<Card variant="dark" class="go">
			<h3><a href={url('about/challenges-and-roadmap/')}>Challenges &amp; Roadmap</a></h3>
			<p>See the three major challenges and the roadmap for addressing them →</p>
		</Card>
	</section>

</SectionLayout>

<style>
	.split {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr;
		gap: 40px;
		align-items: start;
	}
	.split p {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}
	.split :global(.go) {
		position: relative;
	}
	.split :global(.go a) {
		color: inherit;
		text-decoration: none;
	}
	/* Whole card is the click target. */
	.split :global(.go a::after) {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		border-radius: inherit;
	}
	.split :global(.go:hover) {
		border-color: var(--pink);
	}
	@media (max-width: 700px) {
		.split {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 20px;
		}
	}
</style>
